From 0becce95dbf57d35af7cc6eeb3abe7d7e7a30cfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:21:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 49/54] Guide: gamer profile scene transitions

gamerprofile.xex's scenes play the skin's transition visuals (TransFrom /
trans_FadeOut 0-15, TransTo / trans_FadeIn 25-40) on forward and back
navigation; 821 and 828 name none and change at once (xam 81930340: no
visual and no named frames of their own). The outgoing scene is drawn
over the new one with its arrows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D8Y8uNNBmKZ7J6MZXNhzHq
---
 src/xenia/app/guide_overlay.cc | 63 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 src/xenia/app/guide_overlay.h  | 14 ++++++--
 2 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/xenia/app/guide_overlay.cc b/src/xenia/app/guide_overlay.cc
index 96ee23e70..23c70cd07 100644
